Refer to [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for all rules and standards.

Key constraints:
- Pure Go library for AniList GraphQL API.
- Do not import aniSync or external application logic.
- Follow Conventional Commits format for git operations.
- Ensure all public functions accept `context.Context`.
- Wrap errors with `fmt.Errorf("...: %w", err)`.
- Use `net/http/httptest` for all network tests.
